  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "64e8b888",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Two-model daily voltage comparison\n",
    "\n",
    "This block compares two trained GNN models on a full 24-hour daily profile using the same scaled baseline as the dataset generation code (\\(P_\\text{load}=849.12\\,\\text{kW}, Q_\\text{load}=501.12\\,\\text{kVAR}, P_\\text{pv}=975.0\\,\\text{kW}\\)) and the new DSS model.\n",
    "\n",
    "- **What it does**:\n",
    "  - Runs OpenDSS for 288 five-minute steps at the scaled baseline.\n",
    "  - Runs both models on the same graph at each timestep.\n",
    "  - Computes MAE vs OpenDSS for every node for each model.\n",
    "  - Finds the nodes where the models differ most in MAE.\n",
    "  - Plots daily voltage profiles at your chosen nodes and at the most-different nodes.\n",
    "- **Outputs** (in `gnn3_best7_output/` by default):\n",
    "  - `compare_mae_per_node_<model1>_vs_<model2>.csv` with per-node MAE and \\(|\\text{MAE}_1-\\text{MAE}_2|\\).\n",
    "  - PNG plots `compare_24h_<model1>_vs_<model2>_<bus_phase>.png` for each plotted node.\n",
    "\n",
    "You can edit the checkpoint paths, node list, and `--top-k` parameter in the code cell below to match the models and buses you want to inspect."
   ]
  },
