     "text": [
      "================================================================================\n",
      "DATASET / INFERENCE SUMMARY FOR ORIGINAL, INJECTION, AND LOAD-TYPE MODELS\n",
      "================================================================================\n",
      "  DSS file used for baseline inference: C:\\Users\\alita\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\GNN2\\new dss from dr mirzaei\\IEEE34_PV.dss\n",
      "  Baseline totals: P_load=849.12 kW, Q_load=501.12 kVAR, P_pv=975.00 kW\n",
      "[DSS] maxcontroliter=20000\n",
      "\n",
      "================================================================================\n",
      "ORIGINAL MODEL FAMILY\n",
      "================================================================================\n",
      "  Node rows: 5,126,400  Samples: 57,600  Scenarios: 200\n",
      "\n",
      "  Training per-node feature distribution:\n",
